alt_zurueck.description:
This previous control is switched on again, names without “(alt)”, scripts enabled again:
{liste}

In addition, {helfer} helper names are reset and {abhaengig} switched automations/scripts are restored to their original. The new control ({neu}) is switched off.

alt_neu.description:
The previous control is switched off and marked again:
{liste}

The new control ({neu}) is switched on.

alt_loeschen.description:
These automations and scripts will be deleted:
{liste}

Everything is backed up to files first (`config/heizung_universal/<raum>/`). Home Assistant cannot restore deleted items.

**Helpers that are still used elsewhere** (not preselected):
{verwendet}

